  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Irish Aid to Lebanon HF 2025 OCT #75508</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding to the Lebanon Humanitarian Fund for 2025. The Lebanon Humanitarian Fund has projects with particular focuses on gender, nutrition and inclusion of persons of disability. Under the LRP partners including the LHF will advance four strategic objectives: 1. Provide immediate humanitarian assistance to vulnerable populations to ensure critical needs are met. 2. Ensure protection of the vulnerable populations. 3. Support service provision through national systems including national rapid response capacity. 4. Reinforce Lebanon&apos;s economic, social and environmetal stability. Similarly, the 3RP follows 4 strategic directions in its work: 1. Protecting People 2. Pursuing Durable Solutions 3. Contributing to Dignified Lives 4. Enhancing Local and National Capacities.</narrative>
  </description>
